tive:** touch only `[vgt]`-prefixed objects; re-apply removes only its own before recreating.\\n- **Idempotent:** re-running produces no duplicate regions/tracks/markers.\\n- **REAPER API only** (ReaScript), never `.RPP` text edits.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] Applying on `test/Reaper Project` creates the `[vgt]` section regions, tempo map (or the offered marker track), and muted+locked `[vgt] Chords` track.\\n- [ ] Re-apply is idempotent and leaves all non-`[vgt]` objects untouched.\\n- [ ] The tempo-map rule is honored (single-default-marker case writes the map; otherwise offers the marker track).\\n- [ ] Verifier passes on both first apply and re-apply.\\n\",\"comments\":[],\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTcQqas8AAAACsQEnfA\",\"name\":\"status:working\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTcQqas8AAAACsQEoHw\",\"name\":\"implementer:codex\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"0052cc\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTcQqas8AAAACsQEo6Q\",\"name\":\"priority:medium\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"title\":\"Phase 1: apply analysis into the REAPER project\"}\n\n--- files ---\nAGENTS.md\nCLAUDE.md\nREADME.md\nRULES.md\ndocs/AGENTS.md\ndocs/GOAL.md\ndocs/PRIORITIES.md\ndocs/phase0-live-verification.md\ndocs/phase1-song-prep-plan.md\npyproject.toml\nreascript/vgt_initialize.lua\nscripts/verify_phase0_apply.py\nsrc/vgt/__init__.py\nsrc/vgt/analysis.py\nsrc/vgt/cli.py\nsrc/vgt/project.py\nsrc/vgt/py.typed\nsrc/vgt/sidecar.py\nsrc/vgt/tempo.py\ntests/test_analysis.py\ntests/test_project.py\ntests/test_reascript.py\ntests/test_tempo.py\nuv.lock\n\n--- implementation refs ---\n./src/vgt/project.py:24:    tempo: float\n./src/vgt/project.py:60:def _track_blocks(text: str) -> list[tuple[str, str]]:\n./src/vgt/project.py:63:    blocks: list[tuple[str, str]] = []\n./src/vgt/project.py:75:                    blocks.append((start.group(1), text[start.start() : end]))\n./src/vgt/project.py:79:    return blocks\n./src/vgt/project.py:87:    tempo = _TEMPO